{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia","id":1334774,"title":"Garou and xenophobia","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-09-10T00:33:59-07:00","id":1334774,"title":"Garou and xenophobia","content":"Why do Garou still hate vampires in W20, and how their relationships gona work V/W5? <br /> I mean I WANT to like WtA but all their racism toward vampires always made me sick (also we all knew which game line is more popular so VtM-fans can easily be mad at WtA and for a good reasons). This trope is pretty irritating and it's not a greater pleasure to play a supernatural equivalent of Aryan Brotherhood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4950-lashet","user":"Lashet","date":". 09-10-2019, 03:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4950-lashet","name":"Lashet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"281"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T02:32:03-07:00","id":1334782,"title":"","content":"Because vampires are inherently damaging to the Earth and are parasitic predators using humans and spreading a very real corruption around. This is no racism issue, vampires legit DO harm to the people around them and accidentally (or not in some VERY fringe cases) spread the taint of the Wyrm. Garou are creatures of Life and vampires, being undead, are an anti.thesisto that.<br /> <br /> Most garou don't even see the vampires as people, just another version of a spirit possessed human.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T03:03:14-07:00","id":1334785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334782#post1334782\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because vampires are inherently damaging to the Earth and are parasitic predators using humans and spreading a very real corruption around. This is no racism issue, vampires legit DO harm to the people around them and accidentally (or not in some VERY fringe cases) spread the taint of the Wyrm. Garou are creatures of Life and vampires, being undead, are an anti.thesisto that.<br /> <br /> Most garou don't even see the vampires as people, just another version of a spirit possessed human.</div> </div> </div> </div>Pff. Average human made more damage than average vampire - vamp doesn't need to use plastic that much. <br /> Also, Forsakens doesn't hate Requem vampires, until those guys do something harmful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4950-lashet","name":"Lashet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"281"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T03:06:43-07:00","id":1334787,"title":"","content":"1) Garou hate vampires in W20 because W20 is a compilation edition and wasn't written to change the setting in such an impactful way. Yes the trope is stale, but so are plenty in the WoD. The CofD exists if you want something that doesn't set this stuff in stone.<br /> <br /> 2) We have no idea how things are going to be in 5e.<br /> <br /> 3) The Garou hatred of vampires is generally far more a binary thing in VtM than WtA. Sure in WtA the Garou don't like vampires, but they're a fairly low level concern that are more annoying than active targets of hatred. Garou will, after all, team up with vampire temporarily if it's useful to take out something that's a more important target. Even VtM goes there sometimes too.<br /> <br /> 4) The real big &quot;hatreds&quot; are much more specific. The Shadow Lords hate the Tzimisce (is that... really so bad?), the Silent Striders hate the Followers of Set (rather justifiably), etc.<br /> <br /> 5) Frankly, the idea that hating bloodsucking monsters that corrupt people is the same as being a neo-Nazi is... pretty insulting to me as something that real neo-Nazis would love to harm. Vampires aren't some innocent minority being persecuted because some racist asshole thinks they're scum just for being different. Vampires are monsters. The predate on humans. The subvert free will to force people to do things without their consent. They're always one bad moment from murdering people. The Garou might not actually be that much better, but the games firmly put this in &quot;corrupt cops vs. gang members&quot; territory, not neo-Nazis vs.... whatever you think vampires are in this equation.<br /> <br /> 6) People play Sabbat games... so... yeah. Some people do like playing the bad guys.<br /> <br /> 7) The Garou are monsters too. They're flawed beings. That's kinda the point.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T03:12:47-07:00","id":1334788,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lashet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334785#post1334785\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Pff. Average human made more damage than average vampire - vamp doesn't need to use plastic that much.<br /> Also, Forsakens doesn't hate Requem vampires, until those guys do something harmful.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because it is a whole other cosmology in nWoD, compared to oWoD. As for human polluting more, yeah it is a theme in WtA. Vampires though are akin to ticks on humanity that spread disease and make things worse in general.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T03:28:34-07:00","id":1334790,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334787#post1334787\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1<br /> <br /> <br /> 5) Frankly, the idea that hating bloodsucking monsters that corrupt people is the same as being a neo-Nazi is... pretty insulting to me as something that real neo-Nazis would love to harm. Vampires aren't some innocent minority being persecuted because some racist asshole thinks they're scum just for being different. Vampires are monsters. The predate on humans. The subvert free will to force people to do things without their consent. They're always one bad moment from murdering people. The Garou might not actually be that much better, but the games firmly put this in &amp;quot;corrupt cops vs. gang members&amp;quot; territory, not neo-Nazis vs.... whatever you think vampires are in this equation.<br /> <br /> 6) People play Sabbat games... so... yeah. Some people do like playing the bad guys.<br /> <br /> 7) The Garou are monsters too. They're flawed beings. That's kinda the point.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Mages and channellings don't hate vamps that much. Neither werewolves hate them that much. It still can be done in more neutral manner.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4950-lashet","name":"Lashet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"281"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T03:44:31-07:00","id":1334794,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lashet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334790#post1334790\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mages and channellings don't hate vamps that much. Neither werewolves hate them that much. It still can be done in more neutral manner.</div> </div> </div> </div>Werewolves are anything but neutral.<br /> Werewolves, on average, are best described as 'religious fanatics'. Their entire breeding, upbringing and very society revolves around being part of a survival-of-the-fittest warrior culture in the name of their metaphysical creator, and their mission is to fight anything that goes against their percieved order of How The World Should Be. They are probably the most opinionated and set-in-stone-mindset playable faction in the WoD. They are the playable faction where The Cause is more important than the individual, and not because of powerplay politics but as *the* raison d'etre. They're the faction that, while trying to avoid it, take hefty collateral damage as a thing that happens sometimes in the line of their duty, or when trying to plug a violation of the Veil. They have a tribe that literally *hates humans*.<br /> <br /> This all goes so far that they even started several wars on the *other literal children of their goddess* and even exterminated some completely.<br /> <br /> And that's just their human side.<br /> <br /> *Now* you add pure, bridling, supernatural Rage and predatory mindset to that, a force that at times makes them TEAR UP their most loved companions. And they can't even *help it*.<br /> <br /> And *then* you add Vampires that supernaturally reek of the very thing they are raised to destroy, no matter how the vampires in question behave.<br /> Yeah. Sorry, but it makes sense for them to have a burning hate-on for the vampires, no matter what angle you look at it from.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":6606,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","user":"Ambrosia","date":". 09-10-2019, 06:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T03:51:42-07:00","id":1334795,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ambrosia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334794#post1334794\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Werewolves are anything but neutral.<br /> Werewolves, on average, are best described as 'religious fanatics'. Their entire breeding, upbringing and very society revolves around being part of a survival-of-the-fittest warrior culture in the name of their metaphysical creator, and their mission is to fight anything that goes against their percieved order of How The World Should Be. They are probably the most opinionated and set-in-stone-mindset playable faction in the WoD. They are the playable faction where The Cause is more important than the individual. They're the faction that, while trying to avoid it, take hefty collateral damage as a thing that happens sometimes in the line of their duty, or when trying to plug a violation of the Veil.<br /> <br /> And that's just their human side.<br /> <br /> *Now* you add pure, bridling, supernatural Rage and predatory mindset to that, a force that at times makes them TEAR UP their most loved companions. And they can't even *help it*.<br /> <br /> And *then* you add Vampires that supernaturally reek of the very thing they are raised to destroy, no matter how the vampires in question behave.<br /> Yeah. Sorry, but it makes sense for them to have a burning hate-on for the vampires, no matter what angle you look at it from.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well you just described a greatest loosers in the world(looking at the state of the setting even in W20 they actually are). Animals must know their place<br /> <br /> Anyway it's made funs of more popular gameline a haters of WtA. It sucks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4950-lashet","user":"Lashet","date":". 09-10-2019, 06:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4950-lashet","name":"Lashet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"281"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T04:18:55-07:00","id":1334807,"title":"","content":"Not sure if I agree on the &quot;possessed human&quot; part being something that MOST garou believe , but everything else is true.<br /> <br /> Garou are racist, no question there, but that is towards other fera, and to some degree toward other tribes, but this was toned down in revised and W20.<br /> <br /> That said, werewolves are seen as mindless brutes and challenges an fight-oriented vampire can overcome, in the vampire setting. Well, at least since WtA is out and Gangrels can't just learn werewolf rites anymore, like in 1st Edition. That said, werewolves are for the most past not an issue in a vampire game and likewise, vampires are the least of the problems a garou encounters when fighting the wyrm. <br /> <br /> I mean, they sure are minions of the Wyrm, unwillingly but in the essence of their being, but they tend to hide well and cause usually less (short-time) damage than fomori or banes or wyrm cultists or what ever else. So, if a sept has to choose which leads to follow, packs usually won't go the vampire route - if other leads are available.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T04:25:20-07:00","id":1334809,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334787#post1334787\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2) We have no idea how things are going to be in 5e.</div> </div> </div> </div>Except for the werewolf entry in V5, which doesn't indicate any changes in this regard.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T04:29:00-07:00","id":1334813,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>heinrich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334807#post1334807\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not sure if I agree on the &amp;quot;possessed human&amp;quot; part being something that MOST garou believe , but everything else is true.<br /> <br /> Garou are racist, no question there, but that is towards other fera, and to some degree toward other tribes, but this was toned down in revised and W20.<br /> <br /> That said, werewolves are seen as mindless brutes and challenges an fight-oriented vampire can overcome, in the vampire setting. Well, at least since WtA is out and Gangrels can't just learn werewolf rites anymore, like in 1st Edition. That said, werewolves are for the most past not an issue in a vampire game and likewise, vampires are the least of the problems a garou encounters when fighting the wyrm. <br /> <br /> I mean, they sure are minions of the Wyrm, unwillingly but in the essence of their being, but they tend to hide well and cause usually less (short-time) damage than fomori or banes or wyrm cultists or what ever else. So, if a sept has to choose which leads to follow, packs usually won't go the vampire route - if other leads are available.</div> </div> </div> </div>And it sucks. I mean VtM is more popular and it's fandom can justifiedly call Carol a bigots and mindless fanatics","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4950-lashet","name":"Lashet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"281"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T04:45:37-07:00","id":1334816,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lashet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334813#post1334813\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And it sucks. I mean VtM is more popular and it's fandom can justifiedly call Carol a bigots and mindless fanatics</div> </div> </div> </div>So, because people like to play Vampire should mean garou should like vampire?<br /> No! Garou don't even like to play <span style=\"font-size:14px\">'Revenant: The Ravishing'</span> by Black dog. Why? Because it sucks!<br /> <br /> I mean, you go around an try to steal peoples blood, all the while watching your back for not getting stabbed in one intrigue or the other. It is all about betrayal and besting someone else and the loss of humanity. That's right. Loss of humanity is what the game was all about before they introduced other ways of unlife to bend the rules...<br /> <br /> So, of all the people, who play VtM, who really goes into the themes of the game that deep?<br /> How many of them have even tried to play WtA, CtD, HtR - and seen if they would like it better?<br /> <br /> I'm not arguing that VtM is the most popular. It is. It probably wouldn't be if people would give other games a chance.<br /> Most Vampire LARPers I know played Werewolf LARP once and never looked back. Because it is fun, comradery-based and you can play it in the sun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T05:21:43-07:00","id":1334826,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>heinrich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334816#post1334816\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, because people like to play Vampire should mean garou should like vampire?<br /> No! Garou don't even like to play <span style=\"font-size:14px\">'Revenant: The Ravishing'</span> by Black dog. Why? Because it sucks!</div> </div> </div> </div>At least you don't make the biggest fandom of WoD your enemies who will call you characters are facsists and fanatics. Garou would not lose anything without hatred to vampires.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4950-lashet","user":"Lashet","date":". 09-10-2019, 08:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4950-lashet","name":"Lashet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"281"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T05:40:26-07:00","id":1334828,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lashet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334826#post1334826\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">At least you don't make the biggest fandom of WoD your enemies who will call you characters are facsists and fanatics. Garou would not lose anything without hatred to vampires.</div> </div> </div> </div>Except their credibility.<br /> <br /> I mean, what would be the reason to not declare vampires enemies of Gaia?<br /> <br /> They are, by their own rulebooks admission, monsters.<br /> <br /> EDIT:<br /> However, they WtA wouldn't loose anything, if VtM wasn't part of the WoD.<br /> MtA and CtD work so much better with WtA. Even WtO does.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T05:49:29-07:00","id":1334829,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lashet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334826#post1334826\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">At least you don't make the biggest fandom of WoD your enemies who will call you characters are facsists and fanatics.</div> </div> </div> </div>The moment people start confusing the fandom with the characters themselves, and start taking such things personally, the problem isn't the game theme.<br /> <br /> I play a lot of online WoD RPG games. MUSHes and the like. The players there can play whatever they want - vampires, mages, werewolves, changelings, kin, acolytes, Changing Breeds, Mortals, Sorcerors etc.<br /> <br /> The players don't start disliking each other just because their characters dislike each other. It's roleplaying. Collaborative storytelling. They don't log on to play &quot;Vampire&quot; or &quot;Mage&quot;, they log on to play &quot;World of Darkness&quot;, where inherent tensions and conflicts between certain groups are just part of the game. And it works fine.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T05:54:05-07:00","id":1334831,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>heinrich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334828#post1334828\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Except their credibility.<br /> <br /> I mean, what would be the reason to not declare vampires enemies of Gaia?<br /> <br /> They are, by their own rulebooks admission, monsters.<br /> <br /> EDIT:<br /> However, they WtA wouldn't loose anything, if VtM wasn't part of the WoD.<br /> MtA and CtD work so much better with WtA. Even WtO does.</div> </div> </div> </div>Vampires could be their own phenomena, with no connection to Wyrm.<br /> Also, VtM is still the biggest and most importanrt part of oWoD. It is the base for all other splats.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4950-lashet","name":"Lashet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"281"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T06:00:03-07:00","id":1334833,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lashet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334831#post1334831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, VtM is still the biggest and most importanrt part of oWoD. It is the base for all other splats.</div> </div> </div> </div>It makes the most money, yes. But you can play any other gameline without a single vampire in it. You can play *all* of the gamelines without using any of the others, except possibly Orpheus. Vampire just was the first.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T08:04:23-07:00","id":1334853,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ambrosia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334833#post1334833\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It makes the most money, yes. But you can play any other gameline without a single vampire in it. You can play *all* of the gamelines without using any of the others, except possibly Orpheus. Vampire just was the first.</div> </div> </div> </div>I still don't get what this hate bring to the game expect a tension between fans. It just made Carol a hypocrite motherfuckers","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4950-lashet","name":"Lashet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"281"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T10:05:52-07:00","id":1334873,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lashet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334853#post1334853\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I still don't get what this hate bring to the game expect a tension between fans. It just made Carol a hypocrite motherfuckers</div> </div> </div> </div>Explanation why it happens. Garou are creatures of life and vampires are creatures of death. That doesn't mean their fans should hate each other, most of us here play multiple WoD games and for those that don't like WtA the others are still great.<br /> <br /> Also, Carol?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T10:21:48-07:00","id":1334879,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lashet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334853#post1334853\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I still don't get what this hate bring to the game expect a tension between fans.</div> </div> </div> </div>Tension between fans? Again, see: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334829#post1334829\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...29#post1334829</a><br /> Anybody who brings the in-game conflict into RL as actual tension between 'fandoms' needs to take a step back from it all. It's a game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":6606,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","user":"Ambrosia","date":". 09-10-2019, 01:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T10:25:55-07:00","id":1334881,"title":"","content":"Am I the only one who keeps wondering just who this &quot;Carol&quot; is? A friend of OP that plays Werewolf and hates Vampire, maybe?<br /> <br /> At any rate, obviously conflict between Garou and Kindred shouldn't mean conflict between their respective fandoms. In fact, it's very normal for people to enjoy both gamelines.<br /> It makes sense, in universe, for werewolves to hate vampires. If some Werewolf player is giving you grief, OP, your issue should be with that one player, not the game itself.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23725-hardestadttheevenyounger","name":"HardestadtTheEvenYounger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23725_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T10:32:13-07:00","id":1334884,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lashet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334831#post1334831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Vampires could be their own phenomena, with no connection to Wyrm.</div> </div> </div> </div>And within their own gameline, they are. But Garou see everything through a Gaian prism, they don't recognize the Christian God and couldn't imagine crediting the vampire's own beliefs or for them to have any origin beyond the Wyrm. So, to a Garou's eyes, vampires are, at best, walking crimes against Gaia who break Her cycle of life and death or, at worst, world-eating Eldritch Abominations (see Antediluvians).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23725-hardestadttheevenyounger","name":"HardestadtTheEvenYounger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23725_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T10:46:17-07:00","id":1334889,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HardestadtTheEvenYounger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334881#post1334881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Am I the only one who keeps wondering just who this &quot;Carol&quot; is? A friend of OP that plays Werewolf and hates Vampire, maybe?<br /> <br /> At any rate, obviously conflict between Garou and Kindred shouldn't mean conflict between their respective fandoms. In fact, it's very normal for people to enjoy both gamelines.<br /> It makes sense, in universe, for werewolves to hate vampires. If some Werewolf player is giving you grief, OP, your issue should be with that one player, not the game itself.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, this is very common thing here. A vampire fan comes in here saying WtA should be more like VtM, the garou more monstrous and so on. Not realising that the games have different themes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T11:17:20-07:00","id":1334896,"title":"","content":"I think it's a lot less common than it was 20 years ago.<br /> <br /> IME, back when there was just the WoD, the tension between fans of the games was much higher and the OP's concerns could have been more meaningful to me. Call it a silver lining or whatever, but the original end of the WoD, and the start of the (now) CofD, heralded a fairly large unification of WoD fans (esp. as this time period was also a major shift in popular game design, and small press distribution).<br /> <br /> -----------------<br /> <br /> Of course, pretty much everyone in the WoD hates vampires. The idea that it's a specifically Garou thing is... well... a bit of a huh?<br /> <br /> Mages, at best, view them as threats to their own mortal communities and want to at least protect their un-Awakened people from such monsters. The Hermetics want them dead (and have waged two full wars on them) for taking in the Tremere. The Chorus, Cult, and Euthanatos, all view vampires (or at least western vampires) as a direct affront to their beliefs, while most of the rest of the Traditions fine their magic natural horrible enough to not tolerate them either. Oh and of course the Technocracy wants all vampires dead too, even if they're a low priority for the Pogrom.<br /> <br /> In the default Changeling view, vampires are twisted by Banality, making them enemies of most right thinking ones. Most of the changelings believe vampires are a cursed off-shoot of the Red Caps, and even the Red Caps try to twist things so their Kith isn't actually responsible for it. It takes a lot for the Red Caps to come up with an alternative myth on how vampires came about just to absolve a member of their Kith in the distant past... but vampires managed to be disliked enough that they do.<br /> <br /> Wraiths are more neutral on vampires, but vampires are dangerous threats to Wraiths without meaning it (though so are most supernaturals in the WoD). Wraiths really despise any of the Necromancy vampires though, as well they should since those are vampires that are studying ways to enslave them.<br /> <br /> Mummy, Kuei-jin (despite being game lines that started as VtM supplements!), and the Imbued all think normal Western vampires are abominations and best killed off as well.<br /> <br /> Which leaves... Demon... as the one game where the default position on vampires isn't &quot;kill it on sight,&quot; or, &quot;kill it if you can, otherwise wait and kill it when you have a better chance.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T11:25:27-07:00","id":1334898,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334873#post1334873\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Also, Carol?</div> </div> </div> </div> Sorry. My autocorrection hate me<br /> <br /> To Heavy Arms. With all this is true, only Garou has &quot;hunt and kill them whenever you can&quot;.Others can disgust, hate or certainly distrust them but not the whole splat hate all of the whole splat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4950-lashet","user":"Lashet","date":". 09-10-2019, 02:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4950-lashet","name":"Lashet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"281"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T11:31:14-07:00","id":1334900,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334889#post1334889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I mean, this is very common thing here. A vampire fan comes in here saying WtA should be more like VtM, the garou more monstrous and so on. Not realising that the games have different themes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep. And that's could be easily avoided if there weren't that stupid trope.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4950-lashet","name":"Lashet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"281"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T11:32:11-07:00","id":1334901,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lashet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia#post1334774\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why do Garou still hate vampires in W20, and how their relationships gona work V/W5?<br /> I mean I WANT to like WtA but all their racism toward vampires always made me sick (also we all knew which game line is more popular so VtM-fans can easily be mad at WtA and for a good reasons). This trope is pretty irritating and it's not a greater pleasure to play a supernatural equivalent of Aryan Brotherhood.</div> </div> </div> </div>You know when vampires drink blood they produce orgasmic reactions, and they usually do this to unwitting victims. That is all kinds of literal rape. And any vampire that has been around for over a couple years they will probably have killed people, even if unwillingly.<br /> <br /> And besides Salubri and Children of Osiris all factions of vampires revolve around vampires coming first at the expense of human beings. The world is literally a worse place because of them being alive as they usually promote suffering. Mages are pretty neutral, tilting on at least wanting to be more good then bad. Changelings over all do more good then bad. Werewolves are the knives of the world.<br /> <br /> And all the Shen of the Middle Kingdom don't like Cainites because they have no harmony with the World, that includes even many Asian Cainites as the Ravnos even recognize they screw with the wheel of reincarnation.<br /> <br /> Just curious have you read any of the Werewolf Cores or only Vampire ones, this is not a swing against you but it would explain some things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T11:36:49-07:00","id":1334902,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lashet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334900#post1334900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yep. And that's could be easily avoided if there weren't that stupid trope.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Lets put it this way, why would anyone that isn't a vampire want vampires around? And if they did accept vampires existing they would only accept it if Vampires were under a strict code of conduct, which goes against the freedom and standard of living for all the sects.<br /> <br /> By your reckoning is it bad that everyone wants to wipe out Fomori?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T11:37:01-07:00","id":1334903,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334901#post1334901\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You know when vampires drink blood they produce orgasmic reactions, and they usually do this to unwitting victims. That is all kinds of literal rape. And any vampire that has been around for over a couple years they will probably have killed people, even if unwillingly.<br /> <br /> And besides Salubri and Children of Osiris all factions of vampires revolve around vampires coming first at the expense of human beings. The world is literally a worse place because of them being alive as they usually promote suffering. Mages are pretty neutral, tilting on at least wanting to be more good then bad. Changelings over all do more good then bad. Werewolves are the knives of the world.<br /> <br /> And all the Shen of the Middle Kingdom don't like Cainites because they have no harmony with the World, that includes even many Asian Cainites as the Ravnos even recognize they screw with the wheel of reincarnation.<br /> <br /> Just curious have you read any of the Werewolf Cores or only Vampire ones, this is not a swing against you but it would explain some things.</div> </div> </div> </div>I did. All out hatred is the only WtA feature. Others just don't like them.<br /> <br /> Speaking of vampire kiss... Pfaff. Garou literally eat people sometimes. So? Let people make some fun","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4950-lashet","user":"Lashet","date":". 09-10-2019, 02:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4950-lashet","name":"Lashet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"281"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T11:37:15-07:00","id":1334904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lashet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334900#post1334900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yep. And that's could be easily avoided if there weren't that stupid trope.</div> </div> </div> </div>Do you have a need to have garou and kindred/cainites ally in your games? Or is this just you wanting unity?<br /> <br /> As for my point, it isn't about garou hating vampires, VtM is just a different beast from WtA.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T11:45:48-07:00","id":1334910,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lashet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334903#post1334903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I did. All out hatred is the only WtA feature. Others just don't like them.</div> </div> </div> </div>They were literally made to wipe out demons, Garou are literally the antibodies of the Earth, just as Caerns are literally spiritual organs of the universe. Most of the other supernaturals don't actively detract from the universe by existing, changelings keep magic healthy in the world, Mages shape the world (which can be good or bad), ghosts just want to resolve their issues (technically Garou try to get rid of them as well but ideally through benevolent means). What do Vampires add to the world, their gameline's point is literally selfishness and survival? They prey on people, ghouls are psychologically scarred and are separated from their lives before. The only ones who actually try to look out for humanity usually do so because they want their blood for themselves or their secret masters. Cainites are the also the splat that doesn't really have a rule against killing humans if you can do it secretly. Some changelings allow that, and some mages do it and hide it from their fellows, but over all the Supernatural community shy's away from it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T11:47:11-07:00","id":1334911,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lashet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334903#post1334903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I did. All out hatred is the only WtA feature. Others just don't like them.<br /> <br /> Speaking of vampire kiss... Pfaff. Garou literally eat people sometimes. So? Let people make some fun</div> </div> </div> </div>I am sure an Euthanos mage would kill a vampire for insulting the cycle of life. Changelings, depending on the banality rules, might avoid them due to their high banality. If the ST is kinder with banality rules, they'd just kill them.<br /> <br /> As for garou eating humans, it is forbidden in their laws VERY heavily. To eat human means you are literally controlled by the wyrm, a sick ronin or a BSD.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T11:48:15-07:00","id":1334912,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lashet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334903#post1334903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I did. All out hatred is the only WtA feature. Others just don't like them.<br /> <br /> Speaking of vampire kiss... Pfaff. Garou literally eat people sometimes. So? Let people make some fun</div> </div> </div> </div>That's illegal for Garou to do by their own laws, they punish people for doing that... Vampires literally have a background called herd, for using humans you cultivate for easy food...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T12:33:13-07:00","id":1334925,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lashet</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> With all this is true, only Garou has &quot;hunt and kill them whenever you can&quot;.Others can disgust, hate or certainly distrust them but not the whole splat hate all of the whole splat.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's a question of perspective.<br /> <br /> The Technocracy certainly has a &quot;hunt and kill them whenever you can&quot; politic, it's just that they can't right now. So do some Traditions and certain factions within.<br /> <br /> And with the others, I think that much of the so called tolerance it's just a consequence of being more individualistic (lacking a shared policy) or more carefree in general. <hr />Garou *care* about stuff. They're not a society of nihilistic bastards thinking on their self interest above their sacred mission (except when they are, se below). That's why they can't ignore vampires so easily. And they are warriors, figthers, soldiers. So they kill.<br /> <br /> This is important for the game, because it's a game about Raging against evil, against bad stuff.<br /> <br /> Vampires are no bueno...<br /> <br /> Everyone knows this, but while others may turn a blind eye (for whatever reason) you rage.<br /> <br /> It would take a lot from the game *not* being able to rage against them to pander Vampire fans ... And I think fans would come to resent this: I know fans that play a lot of vampire, but then like to chill out and hate vampires as Garou. <hr /><br /> That being said, Garou aren't a hive mind. If they were, no Garou would ever defect to the BSD or have a Metis.<br /> <br /> Garou thinking an alliance with vampires it's a good idea in spite of their oral tradition saying the contrary, or even thinking that not ALL vampires are equally bad are possible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T12:53:46-07:00","id":1334933,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334889#post1334889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I mean, this is very common thing here. A vampire fan comes in here saying WtA should be more like VtM, the garou more monstrous and so on. Not realising that the games have different themes.</div> </div> </div> </div>More monstrous? The BSD look at the worst of the Sabbat's rites and think that they're adorable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23725-hardestadttheevenyounger","name":"HardestadtTheEvenYounger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23725_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T13:08:55-07:00","id":1334938,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aleph</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1334774-garou-and-xenophobia?p=1334925#post1334925\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It would take a lot from the game *not* being able to rage against them to pander Vampire fans</div> </div> </div> </div>WHAT would it take from WtA? Inner logic? oWoD never have one. On the other hand - VtM-fans would not look down on your very favorite splat as on the fascists and until your became the splat's worst hater (that's my case). <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":"